00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
- I mean, look, he's
the kinda guy it's just,

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.760
just understand the psychology, right?

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.315
He's the kind of guy where
if, you know, if he thought,

00:00:07.315 --> 00:00:09.690
and again, I'm not saying
this is what happened,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.450
I'm saying, just talking his perspective.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.530
If he thought he'd be beaten
fair and square, he'd say,

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.840
all right, and he'd pack up, he'd go home,

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.830
but if he thought something
was stolen from him,

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:21.170
or if he thought something
was taken away from him,

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.410
then does he really seem like
the kinda guy that's just

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.620
gonna let that happen,
just gonna let that slide?

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.810
Of course not, no.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:28.660
He's gonna be the guy who's
gonna want to get back in

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.270
and take back what he,
you know, right or wrong,

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:35.622
views as something that is rightfully his.

00:00:35.622 --> 00:00:38.372
(dramatic music)

