- Neither would I, man.

00:01:24.048 --> 00:01:25.860
- At this point, where
we're at in the world,

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.580
it's like pretty much anything's possible.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.440
This is proof of that, I think.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.030
- Yeah, you know, when
they reached out to me,

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:34.050
so it's with Brave Books,
and they have the whole thing

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:36.361
