00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.400
makes sense as long as it's in the saga,

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.520
but each story kind of
feeds into the other one.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.490
It's sort of a shared, you
know, like Marvel universe

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.190
