00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.775
So they go to the island of
the wolves and guess what

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:18.890
turns out, spoiler alert,
right, it's not very good

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.390
on the island of free ice cream.

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:22.570
It's actually quite bad
and you can't get out,

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:24.290
and there's like this
Berlin wall surrounding it.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:27.058
So it's like a Cuba, East
