and I said, look, that's,

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:55.940
that's where Brave Books comes in.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:59.130
So it's actually really
cool any way you can start

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:01.176
to have those discussions,
like, okay, you know,

00:07:01.176 --> 00:07:04.370
it, yeah, I wish things
were free too, right.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:06.020
Wouldn't that be great?

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:08.700
Wouldn't it be awesome
