00:08:20.007 --> 00:08:21.657
"Each month we will release a new story

00:08:21.657 --> 00:08:24.100
"which teaches a foundational
conservative value."

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.810
So you already hit on
this, but do you think

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.820
that's where we're at as
a society at this point,

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.445
that depending on what
your political beliefs are,

00:08:30.445 --> 00:08:33.610
you're literally gonna have
different children's books.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.100
You're going to have different schools.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:37.070
You are going to have
different businesses,

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.635
ultimately different
tech, and just, you know,

00:08:39.635 --> 00:08:42.408
as far down the road, as you
want to run that concept.

00:08:42.408 --> 00:08:44.897
- Well, it's, it's really
interesting because, you know,

00:08:44.897 --> 00:08:47.590
and I know you talk about
this a lot that a lot of this

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.150
started with relativism
and the idea that there

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.850
are no, you know, absolute,

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:53.940
there's no good, there's
no bad, there's just, it's,

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:55.830
it's, what was the phrase
that seeped into our culture?

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.514
It's not the truth, it's
my truth and your truth,

00:08:58.514 --> 00:09:01.050
and it was like, whoa, wait,
wait, if we can't agree

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:04.242
on basic facts and we can't
agree on basic morality,

00:09:04.242 --> 00:09:06.650
then what's gonna happen, right?

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.450
This is exactly what
happens because of that,

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:13.310
because we took away objective
morality in society, right.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:14.790
We took that away, we rejected it.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.670
We replaced it with what,
with nothing, right,

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.545
and we tried to do that for
a while, but it didn't work,

00:09:18.545 --> 00:09:22.130
but then up along comes
this new ideology and says,

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.540
we are the new morality.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.667
We are social morality.

00:09:24.667 --> 00:09:27.640
The government has
essentially replaced God in,

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.863
in this sort of this like
inverted hierarchy and then,

00:09:29.863 --> 00:09:33.070
so the, the, the leading
purveyors of the government,

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.730
the bureaucrats, the
experts, you know, they are,

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:37.330
they are the high priests
and the accolades, et cetera,

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:42.330
et cetera, and so these
books then seek to impose

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:45.460
that new morality, right, on our kids,

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.946
and, and it's, it's a
false reality in many ways,

00:09:47.946 --> 00:09:51.150
but also because it just doesn't line up

